Though bodily unharmed, it uttered cries as some king's ghost in supernatural

85
00:07:33,759 --> 00:07:39,039
distress. Through its inexpressable, strange eyes, me thought I peeped to

86
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:44,717
secrets which took hold of God. As Abraham before the angels I bowed

87
00:07:44,718 --> 00:07:50,557
myself, the white thing was so white, its wings so wide, and in those forever

88
00:07:50,558 --> 00:07:55,758
exiled waters, I had lost the miserable warping memories of traditions and of

89
00:07:55,759 --> 00:08:02,158
towns. Long I gazed at that prodigy of plumage. I cannot tell, can only hint

